    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document defines a Uniform Resource Name (URN) namespace
identifier enabling the generation of URNs that are appropriate for
use in documentation and in URN-related testing and experimentation.</t>
    </abstract>
